data.recommendation:
In nginx (both main site and media host), add to the server block:

```
add_header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload" always;
add_header Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://media.thedownundernews.online; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; script-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self';" always;
add_header X-Frame-Options "DENY" always;
add_header X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff" always;
add_header Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" always;
add_header Permissions-Policy "geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()" always;
add_header Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy "same-origin" always;
add_header Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy "same-origin" always;
```

Validate with https://securityheaders.com after deployment.

In the nginx HTTP (port 80) server block, pin the redirect to the intended hostname:

```
server {
  listen 80;
  server_name www.thedownundernews.online thedownundernews.online;
  return 301 https://www.thedownundernews.online$request_uri;
}
server {
  listen 80 default_server;
  return 444;    # drop any Host that is not ours
}
```

Restrict nginx `ssl_ciphers` to only AEAD suites (modern profile from Mozilla SSL Config Generator):

```
ssl_ciphers 'ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-ECDSA-CHACHA20-POLY1305';
ssl_prefer_server_ciphers off;
ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
```
